 "summary": "Enacts the \"access to justice in lending act\"; relates to a mortgagor's right to recover attorney's fees in actions or proceedings arising out of foreclosures of residential property which consists of a one- to four-family residence, condominium that is occupied by the mortgagor or cooperative unit that is occupied by the mortgagor; provides reciprocal attorney's fees.",
 "title": "Enacts the \"access to justice in lending act\"",
